   "raw": {
    "description": "Size and propose a broker trade. Supplying idempotencyKey uses the auto-only keyed path; MT5 may place LIVE broker state inline, while MetaApi returns pending execution. Without a key this remains the normal two-step intent flow. Provide exactly one of riskPercent or riskAmount; entryPrice is required for limit/stop. Push-mode intents are sent to the user's device and must not be executed by the agent. Requires sign-in.",
